#: ../../source/classes/class_modifyandroidbuildtemplateplugin.rst:16 89ce1c6c32944626b2fabfea59f13b84
msgid "Editor plugin for installing FMOD Android libraries into the Android build template."
msgstr "将 FMOD Android 库安装到 Android 构建模板中的编辑器插件。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_modifyandroidbuildtemplateplugin.rst:21 9595addc07b74e23aa878e0917c6c5d8
msgid "Description"
msgstr "描述"

#: ../../source/classes/class_modifyandroidbuildtemplateplugin.rst:23 580173c9cae9405689ceffc55fdb37af
msgid ""
"ModifyAndroidBuildTemplatePlugin is an editor-only plugin that simplifies the installation of "
"FMOD Android libraries into Godot's Android build template. It provides a GUI for selecting the "
"FMOD Android API folder and automatically copies the required files (fmod.jar and native "
"libraries) to the correct locations."
msgstr ""
"ModifyAndroidBuildTemplatePlugin 用于在编辑器中选择 FMOD Android API 目录，并将 fmod.jar 和原生库复制到 Godot Android "
"构建模板的对应位置。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_modifyandroidbuildtemplateplugin.rst:25 a99b16dcd39f435aa0b2fe24b1303545
msgid ""
"This plugin adds a menu item \"Install FMOD Android Libraries\" to the editor's Tools menu. When "
"activated, it:"
msgstr "插件在编辑器的工具菜单中添加“Install FMOD Android Libraries”菜单项，执行以下操作："

#: ../../source/classes/class_modifyandroidbuildtemplateplugin.rst:27 71bfd6a154ff4fa7b3ec986be34635e1
msgid "Checks if the Android build template is installed"
msgstr "检查是否已安装 Android 构建模板"

#: ../../source/classes/class_modifyandroidbuildtemplateplugin.rst:29 e83cf5a8995c4a968e593039400d7ae3
msgid "Prompts for the FMOD Android API folder location"
msgstr "提示选择 FMOD Android API 目录"

#: ../../source/classes/class_modifyandroidbuildtemplateplugin.rst:31 da968414da214e98aaa050dc93c0dba2
msgid "Copies fmod.jar to the libs folder"
msgstr "将 fmod.jar 复制到 libs 目录"

#: ../../source/classes/class_modifyandroidbuildtemplateplugin.rst:33 cb017114473242b1bbad3104d7f9d368
msgid "Copies native libraries for all supported architectures (arm64-v8a, armeabi-v7a, x86, x86_64)"
msgstr "为支持的架构复制原生库，包括 arm64-v8a、armeabi-v7a、x86 和 x86_64"

#: ../../source/classes/class_modifyandroidbuildtemplateplugin.rst:35 dfdb602afd2c482cb4c2f52cc20af3ad
msgid "Creates separate debug and release configurations"
msgstr "分别创建 debug 和 release 配置"

#: ../../source/classes/class_modifyandroidbuildtemplateplugin.rst:37 14ce6133c4ba452887de5c2f19e918b2
msgid "\\ **Note:** This is an editor-only class and is not available in exported projects."
msgstr "**注意：**    此类仅在编辑器中可用，导出项目中不可用。"
